flowchart TB
  Events["Recent runtime events from authorized collectors"] --> Fingerprint["Model + tools + planning/action + multi-step/memory/delegation"]
  Fingerprint --> Enough{Combined agent behavior?}
  Enough -->|No| Uncertain["Non-agent or uncertain; retain evidence"]
  Enough -->|Yes| Registration{Operator registration exists?}
  Registration -->|Yes| Registered[Registered agent candidate]
  Registration -->|No| Shadow["Shadow candidate: review recommended"]
  Shadow --> Evidence["Explain behavioral signals, sources, capabilities, and score"]
  Evidence --> Review["Human review; no automatic trust approval"]
